Mutation bites (isolated clone at 9f99e2264c + cherry-pick 38d253fb0c; checkout untouched):
A) deleted bite: disabled the expectedSessionId guard in server-restart-sentinel.ts
   (if (false && ...)). Result: exit 1,
   AssertionError: expected 1 to be +0 on the pending-queue poll - without the guard the row
   stays parked forever instead of dead-lettering. Raw log: t2-mutacion-guarda-sesion-borrada.log
B) busy bite: disabled the managed-delivery deferral (admitted-turn parking). Result: exit 1,
   AssertionError: expected +0 to be 1 on the pre-restart pending-row poll - without the
   deferral the delivery is consumed immediately instead of waiting. A first form of this
   mutation (if (false && ...)) broke the declaration build with TS2339 and was discarded for
   a type-preserving form. Raw log: t2-mutacion-sin-aplazamiento.log
